{"id":"1db7bc84524d0fdb","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-reflection-instance.md","title":"Reflection Principle Instance","display":"ex-reflection-instance — Reflection Principle Instance","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-reflection-instance","aliases":["89-ex-reflection-instance"],"display":"ex-reflection-instance — Reflection Principle Instance","depends_on":["[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-numeral]]","[[89-df-reflection-principle]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-reflection-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-reflection-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-reflection-instance — Reflection Principle Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"396f9d3c403d0603\" href=\"?note=396f9d3c403d0603\" title=\"89-df-reflection-principle\">89-df-reflection-principle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is its local reflection schema.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\coloneqq(0=0)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\theta\\coloneqq(0=0)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\theta}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner})\\to\\theta\">\\(\\rho_{\\theta}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner})\\to\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\rho_{\\theta}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner 0=0\\urcorner})\\to 0=0\n\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{RFN}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\rho_{\\theta}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner 0=0\\urcorner})\\to 0=0\n\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{RFN}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> : 可证性谓词</li>\n<li>reflection : 反射原则 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"396f9d3c403d0603\" href=\"?note=396f9d3c403d0603\" title=\"89-df-reflection-principle\">89-df-reflection-principle</a>)</li>\n<li>这是反射模式的一个具体对象语言句子</li>\n<li>不把“对所有公式”误写成算术对象语言中的无编码量化</li>\n<li>Gödel 编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner0=0\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner0=0\\urcorner\\)</span> 是元层自然数；横线把它变成可代入\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> 的对象语言数码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"396f9d3c403d0603","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"396f9d3c403d0603","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"reflection : 反射原则 (see [[89-df-reflection-principle]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\coloneqq(0=0)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{\\theta}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner})\\to\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\rho_{\\theta}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner 0=0\\urcorner})\\to 0=0\n\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{RFN}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner0=0\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-584","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-ex-reflection-instance]]"}],"outgoing":["7f53d84c2164d9c5","d088b00b91690ba0","396f9d3c403d0603"]}